==Finnish==
{{Finnish index|k|u}}

===Etymology===
Possibly from {{inh|fi|urj-pro|*kumpa||wave}}, whence also eg. {{cog|hu|hab||foam}}. {{der|fi|gem}} origin is also possible, compare {{cog|gem-pro|*humpaz}} (whence {{cog|en|hump}}).

===Noun===
{{fi-noun}}

# A [[hummock]], [[hillock]] (small natural elevation of earth, generally smaller than {{m|fi|kukkula||hill}}, larger than {{m|fi|kumpare||knoll}}).
# A [[mound]] (small, rounded, artificial elevation of earth).

